     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Progress bar is suitable for a wide range of applications, from simple file uploads to more intricate multi-step processes. Depending on the specific use case, the Progress bar allows for animated indicators or precise progress representation. If the duration of the process is unknown and it is not possible to display a percentage completed, it is advisable to use Progress Indicator component instead.",
